  "fullDescription": "If you love the look of pressed and dried flowers, this background is for you! It’s a flatlay photo completely filled with dried flowers in soft, warm tones. You can spot roses, daisies, marigolds, hydrangeas, lavender, poppy seed heads, and lots of little wildflowers scattered throughout. The overall colour palette is a mix of pink, orange, yellow, lilac and cream, giving it a very romantic and natural feel.\nIt works well as a background for social media graphics, digital planners, mood boards, or any floral or botanical themed design project.\n\nPLEASE NOTE:\n\n* The size of the background is 2050 × 2050 px\n* This is NOT a seamless background\n* This background is meant for digital use only\n* The file type is PNG\n\nDon’t forget to follow my shop if you like beautiful backgrounds and realistic clipart 🙂",
